  "content": "<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 關於《艾爾登法環：夜統治者裝備》</strong></h2><p>FazBrick 工作室團隊隆重推出《艾爾登法環：夜統治者裝備》。這是一款輕量簡易的模組，將來自遊戲《艾爾登法環：夜統治者》的六套標誌性盔甲引入 Minecraft。</p><p>本模組設計旨在與原版遊戲無縫融合，讓玩家在探索 Minecraft 世界時，能享受傳奇盔甲的風采。</p><p>《艾爾登法環：夜統治者裝備》相容於現代版本的 Minecraft，並會在需要時進行小幅更新。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73fec028-7748-4d80-9af6-ffa984bbf233.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c88b3124-8b97-41c1-ac97-3978b3b5c76d.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5c4b67d5-da89-487b-a776-2554b9096719.png\"></p><p><strong> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fMrFazCraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_fe39d778-c7f5-4342-8aed-fb925a1c4e16.png\"> </a></strong></p><p>🗡️ <strong>立即展開你的黑暗靈魂之旅！</strong> 透過 Nitrado 和 Apex Hosting 提供的一鍵伺服器安裝，您和您的朋友可以迅速投入《黑暗靈魂擴展》的殘酷世界！</p><p>要開始使用，您只需要一個至少擁有 <strong>4GB 或更多 RAM</strong> 的 Minecraft Java 伺服器（建議用於多人遊戲以獲得流暢體驗）。只需從控制面板<strong>點擊一下</strong>，即可立即安裝《黑暗靈魂擴展 [CurseForge]》，今天就開始您的危險冒險！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>也試試官方的黑暗靈魂擴展模組包！</strong></h2><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/echoes-of-londor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_49fcd2fd-eab0-49e9-b7e0-c1bedc4653d4.png\" width=\"281\" height=\"286\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以將此模組放入模組包嗎？</strong></h2><p>當然可以！歡迎將此模組加入您的模組包。我鼓勵您這麼做，只需記得標註出處即可。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 再散布許可</strong></h2><p><strong>您不得在 Curseforge 以外的網站或網域上傳或再散布此模組。</strong></p><p><strong>這特別包括 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
